## Step 5: Filtering (bcftools filter)

### Commands

Filtering raw variant calls under two distinct quality thresholds and computing corresponding summary statistics.

```bash
#filtering gentle
bcftools filter -e 'QUAL < 20 || INFO/DP < 5' yeast_samples_raw.vcf.gz -O z -o gentle_filtered.vcf.gz

#filtering stringent
bcftools filter -e 'QUAL < 30 || INFO/DP < 10 || INFO/MQ < 40' yeast_samples_raw.vcf.gz -O z -o stringent_filtered.vcf.gz
```

```bash
# bcftools stats on gentle
bcftools stats gentle_filtered.vcf.gz > gentle_stats.txt

# bcftools stats on stringent
bcftools stats stringent_filtered.vcf.gz > stringent_stats.txt
```

